#: ../source/vms-beacon-monitoring.rst:3
#: 6184c804d5b14614a746b36c87633a2a
msgid "VMS beacon monitoring"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/vms-beacon-monitoring.rst:5
#: 52d323736e314141a01b4199b069e154
msgid "A module of Monitorfish is dedicated to monitoring the emission of VMS beacons - which are required by law to emit constantly."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/vms-beacon-monitoring.rst:7
#: 52d323736e314141a01b4199b069e154
msgid "When a VMS beacon ceases to emit (see :doc:`flows/update-beacon-malfunctions`), a malfunction is generated in Monitorfish. Malfunctions can be tracked in a dedicated kanban (*\"Suivi VMS\"*, super users) until the malfunction is resolved."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/vms-beacon-monitoring.rst:10
#: 389698286064437c927bfc1d679f3c84
msgid "Kanban of beacon malfunctions"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/vms-beacon-monitoring.rst:14
#: 11f3bc874d434edfa7235a87792f22ce
msgid "For each malfunction, FMC agents can :"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/vms-beacon-monitoring.rst:16
#: 417ec20c41a6468e9a76b4c204eafcd0
msgid "move it between the stages of the kanban, and update the status of the vessel (at sea, at port, activity detected...)"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/vms-beacon-monitoring.rst:17
#: a49f564c266f41d9af560170c95bb84a
msgid "add comments, and read the history of the malfunction"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/vms-beacon-monitoring.rst:18
#: 3e5c1e205ba54a7394607798425222a8
msgid "send notifications to the vessel captain and operator, and to the satellite operator - initial notification, reminder, end of malfunction - or notify a foreign FMC when the vessel is in foreign waters. Notifications are sent by email, SMS and fax by the :doc:`flows/notify-beacon-malfunctions` flow."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/vms-beacon-monitoring.rst:22
#: 00dac5e95e474cabaeb103575abd404a
msgid "The history of beacon malfunctions of each vessel is also visible in its :doc:`vessel sheet <vessel-sheet>`."
msgstr ""
